# tailwind typescript button lab issues

## TypeScript 7 requires an explicit `rootDir`

compatibility: keeping the current `create-turbo@latest` TypeScript 7.0.2 version while adding the lab's `outDir` setting causes `yarn workspace @repo/ui build` to exit with `TS5011`. TypeScript no longer infers `src` as the common source directory when a project uses `tsconfig.json`

workaround: add `"rootDir": "src"` beside `"outDir": "dist"` in `packages/ui/tsconfig.json`, then rerun `yarn workspace @repo/ui build`

